{"availability":"available","full":"murat48/QuietStay","name":"QuietStay","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-17T14:08:43Z","updated":"2026-10-10T10:35:22Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://quietstay.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://quietstay.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:42.587Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:42.587Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:42.587Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:06:42.587Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Rent or sell a timeshare week you cannot use — and let the buyer verify it is real, without publishing who you are, where the resort is, or what your deed says.","A timeshare owner who cannot travel this year has no simple way to pass the week on. Transfers are slow, broker-dependent, and fee-heavy, and a buyer has no way to check who really holds the week or whether it carries unpaid maintenance fees. QuietStay puts the week on Stellar so those checks take seconds, and keeps the deed, the name and the address off the ledger while doing it.","Phase 2: every rental and sale is authorized by a zero-knowledge proof the contract verifies on chain — Groth16 over BLS12-381 — and by nobody's permission. The issuer, which approved every transfer in Phase 1, has no part in them any more."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/murat48/QuietStay/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"89548ba2aae522310a43f7d08795072647cab99ae8fbe08bbb67345d1e9f7f1d","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:42.663Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:42.663Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Rent or sell a timeshare week you cannot use — and let the buyer verify it is real, without publishing who you are, where the resort is, or what your deed says.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/murat48/QuietStay/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Public by design: account addresses, the week's dates, and a rental's end, because a listing has to say what it offers and a rental that ends by itself needs the contract to know when.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/murat48/QuietStay/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Absent from this repository: mainnet deployment, a security audit, a production trusted-setup ceremony, in-browser proving, selective disclosure, any new cryptographic primitive, swaps between owners, payment and escrow, real resorts and legal title transfer, and passkey login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/murat48/QuietStay/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"89548ba2aae522310a43f7d08795072647cab99ae8fbe08bbb67345d1e9f7f1d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/murat48/QuietStay/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:42.664Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T10:35:22Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/murat48/QuietStay/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:42.664Z","hash":"89548ba2aae522310a43f7d08795072647cab99ae8fbe08bbb67345d1e9f7f1d","originalBytes":14341,"storedBytes":14341,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","phase","week","what","issuer","proof","contract","holder","one","npm","poseidon","run","transfer","buyer","every","secret","circuits","ledger","which","account","cannot","check","circuit","evidence.md","gpl","record","rental","tests","against","chain","circuit.md","code","inventory","nothing","prove","real","sale","verify","about","bls12-381","checks","commitment","deed","each","move","only","own","prover","wallet","app","attestation","computes","contracts","could","design.md","gpl-3.0","holds","license","over","owner","page","phase2","proving","records","runs","server","setup","setup.md","src","stellar","unit","week.","who","whose","any","authorization","browser","buy","carrying","